Changes from scmhub/calendar: the hand-written holiday rule engine was replaced
by tables generated from pandas_market_calendars; calendars cover a fixed date
range instead of a rolling +/-5 year window; and out-of-range dates no longer
panic. The module path is github.com/bjo/go-market-calendars.

The files in data/ and exchanges_gen.go are generated from:

pandas_market_calendars
  https://github.com/rsheftel/pandas_market_calendars
  Licensed under the MIT License.

exchange_calendars (via pandas_market_calendars)
  https://github.com/gerrymanoim/exchange_calendars
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
  https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

The generated tables are factual schedule data (dates and trading hours)
derived from these projects. Their copyright notices and licences are
reproduced here as required.
